    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Asking the price and the size",
     "texto": [
      "Hvor mye koster denne genseren? means «How much does this jumper cost?». Koster does not change with the subject: it is the same for «it costs» and «they cost». To ask about the size: Hvilken størrelse vil du ha?",
      "The currency of Norway is the krone, krone; in the plural, kroner. It is not the crown (the object): the context of prices shows the currency. In a price you say, for example, tre hundre kroner («three hundred Norwegian kroner»)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
